v 3
d dwlsmv. Diagonally weighted least squares SEM/CFA for ordinal indicators with mean- and variance-adjusted (WLSMV, T3) test
d
d dwlsmv fits sem-style models to ordinal and binary indicators by DWLS with the scaled-and-shifted (T3) test.
d The Mata code ships as a compiled library, ldwlsmv.mlib, built by Stata 16.1.
d
d Requires: Stata version 16. Tested on Stata 16.1 and 18.
d Version: 0.3.0
d Author: Erik Ruzek
d Support: https://github.com/bbachilles/dwlsmv/issues
d License: GPL-3.0-or-later
d Distribution-Date: 20261104
d
f dwlsmv.ado
f _dwlsmv_translate.ado
f dwlsmv.sthlp
f ldwlsmv.mlib
f dwlsmv_example.dta
f difftest.ado
